BART HAZER: Node.

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:48.360
VINOD RAMACHANDRAN: Yes.

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:49.730
BART HAZER: That
sounds really cool.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:50.560
VINOD RAMACHANDRAN: Yeah.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:51.060
Yeah.

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:53.440
And we have a product, and
