00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.160
Tasks.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:47.700
So to just kind of give you a
brief introduction to Vendasta,

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:51.620
we're in Saskatoon,
Saskatchewan up in Canada.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:54.480
And we build a
