00:29:19.880 --> 00:29:22.500
So we talked about a lot
of the tasks use cases,

00:29:22.500 --> 00:29:24.862
how to create a task and so on.

00:29:24.862 --> 00:29:27.320
And we said that we could also
do monitoring and monitoring

00:29:27.320 --> 00:29:28.520
from the CLI.

00:29:28.520 --> 00:29:34.580
So I'm going to try to
look at the list of queues

