system and set the rate

00:32:16.928 --> 00:32:18.390
to that particular value.

00:32:18.390 --> 00:32:20.640
To start this, I'm going
to start step by step.

00:32:20.640 --> 00:32:23.370
I'm going to first set the
rate to a really low value

00:32:23.370 --> 00:32:27.150
