00:32:46.180 --> 00:32:50.140
But as you go, I come into
the UI and I see, one by one,

00:32:50.140 --> 00:32:52.240
the tasks are getting cued up.

00:32:52.240 --> 00:32:55.360
But the progress is fairly slow.

00:32:55.360 --> 00:32:56.530
You can clearly see it.

00:32:56.530 --> 00:32:59.110
The rate's like one per second.

00:32:59.110 --> 00:33:00.010
Six are completed.

00:33:00.010 --> 00:33:01.360
It's fairly slow.

00:33:01.360 --> 00:33:03.890
And I know that I can do better.

00:33:03.890 --> 00:33:05.390
So how better can I do?

00:33:05.390 --> 00:33:08.020
So let's do 10x of what I give.

00:33:08.020 --> 00:33:13.120
So let's try to set the value
