get initialized,

00:33:56.260 --> 00:33:58.230
but in the process--

00:33:58.230 --> 00:34:00.700
so my goal is to set
it to a higher rate.

00:34:00.700 --> 00:34:02.290
And as I set it
to a higher rate--

00:34:13.030 --> 00:34:15.190
let's just wait for a
