00:34:18.290 --> 00:34:20.199
So the goal is to set
it to a higher rate

00:34:20.199 --> 00:34:22.300
and see if that
particular higher rate is

00:34:22.300 --> 00:34:24.230
optimal for Cloud Tasks or not.

00:34:24.230 --> 00:34:27.047
And if not, try to see if you
can take corrective action

00:34:27.047 --> 00:34:27.630
based on that.

00:34:31.523 --> 00:34:32.690
This is quicker in practice.

00:35:03.400 --> 00:35:03.900
All right.

00:35:03.900 --> 00:35:05.720
I'm going to set it
to a different queue.

00:35:15.163 --> 00:35:16.157
All right.

00:35:36.020 --> 00:35:36.520
All right.

00:35:36.520 --> 00:35:38.290
It takes about a minute
for this to set up

00:35:38.290 --> 00:35:41.380
because I've set up some QPS
limits based on the engine

00:35:41.380 --> 00:35:43.040
